  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_945056aa-921e-44e4-85dd-f45231940861.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"316\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/potionstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4bce6dd3-7af5-4014-a705-04cd0c0adb87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zQA4eez2eS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2e3d72d9-91b0-4d00-8eef-26be28254a6c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252f_AOCAWOL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_84597b2e-8453-472a-9043-329d8218ac75.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a> &nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>「你的腦袋裡有頭腦，你的腳下有鞋子。你可以讓自己朝任何選擇的方向前進。你獨自一人，而你知道你所知道的一切。而你自己，將決定該往何處去。」</em></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>——蘇斯博士，《喔，你要去的地方！》</em>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_a1820aba-6e98-496b-954b-53c078297080.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"71\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wayfinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_f80168f8-5c01-42cf-a924-b36e91cafca5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"594\" height=\"101\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-descent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_7acdccbe-8e6f-49f6-bde2-ee820d4370a9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"596\" height=\"68\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_10da38ee-7e1c-4d1d-9bf5-d07267b232ad.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"616\" height=\"116\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930;font-size:18px\">「Oh The Biomes We've Gone」是經典模組「Oh The Biomes You'll Go」的續作，支援 1.20 以上版本，新增超過 50 個令人驚嘆、奇幻且逼真的生態域。BWG 將帶你踏上冒險旅程，為 Minecraft 注入豐富多樣的細節與生命力。此外，BWG 還新增了獨特的生物、結構以及數百個可供運用的方塊。</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_43d7961e-7fe6-4cab-9073-f96e1a05c5bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"793\" height=\"416\"></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">正在尋找 1.19 及以下版本的支援嗎？請參考 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</span></a>！</p>",
